{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f24d9f9a6b1c5a8f97a3bc2198ccb58c0eebd2145a1d25357b9fb16e075a6623", "ja": "（今日は楽団と一緒の仕事だったやよい。グラビアに\nライブにと、すごく様になっていた）", "zh": "（今天弥生和乐团一起工作。无论是写真拍摄还是现场演出，她都非常有模有样）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8fab17b5b97086b7c9f396e9ac3a86dafd30c1136b53ccd19d3d4efff7dab6cd", "ja": "お疲れ様、やよい。もう着替えは終わったかな？\n今日は内容盛り沢山だったからな、帰りは送るよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，弥生。已经换好衣服了吗？\n今天安排得很满，回去我送你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "cbd4fc76160b983916983b4a74c1d00b84654632a5c7707f1961bad480e04ee3", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です！\nありがとうございますー♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n谢谢您～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "be85dde9cf5b50480486dc0092e35ef2445906e3551d3205bbe755b03ce068d4", "ja": "あ！　どうでしたか、私のトランペット。\n練習したんですけど、上手に吹けてました？", "zh": "啊！觉得我的小号吹得怎么样？\n我练习过了，吹得还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8ebfbbae2b3033840da8f1d73385525408f56b1e4c1914536e11b09a9780bcbf", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだったよ！　しかし驚いたな。\n撮影だけの予定だったのに、ライブでも使ったりして。", "zh": "啊，吹得棒极了！不过真让我吃了一惊。\n本来只计划拍摄，没想到还在演唱会上用上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "f68eb1bd30dbdbd0630ad7be7c80db021606817cf10abd82bb167268ff543bf9", "ja": "えへへ、休憩中に練習してきれいな音が出せるように\nなったら、なんだか楽しくなっちゃって♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，休息的时候练习了一下，能吹出好听的声音之后，就觉得特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "e2a77653928c039b158fdd3c8ce7239b4a50190e536736d979945c144854ca3f", "ja": "スタッフさんの詳しい人にも教えてもらったおかげで、\nド～♪　からド～♪　まで吹けるようになりました！", "zh": "多亏工作人员里懂行的人教了我，\n我已经能从哆～♪吹到哆～♪了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a8dbbc9f475772e140ad3a31284a67ed66f71c991897ab732f91aa1676ccde49", "ja": "おお、すごいじゃないか。\nすっかりトランペットにハマっちゃったみたいだな。", "zh": "哦，真厉害啊。看来你已经彻底迷上小号了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "b1349c1c877d8f4ebdd12f95321770e065ee60090e46d5eacc7a47f4e6d371aa", "ja": "はい！　だから、今はちょっと寂しくて……。", "zh": "是的！所以现在有点寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1009_p", "source_sha256": "36781c9f98cd9ae1e4563812316658b1bd0aaa7867728d2540e39389b9132890", "ja": "寂しい？", "zh": "寂寞？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "a8dc910a953f53d48340499956b87bbe531de4d230c856a7be3767b4ef6afd8c", "ja": "だって、撮影が終わっちゃったから、\nもう吹くことがなくなっちゃうじゃないですか？", "zh": "因为拍摄已经结束了，之后就没机会再吹了，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "7c9aa4ae77c7bafa21a5b730acf0c096e31c289486a0a054ec1ece4aabb26f02", "ja": "せっかく吹けるようになったから、練習してもっと\nもっと上手になりたかったなーって。えへへ……。", "zh": "好不容易学会吹了，本来还想继续练习，变得更、更加熟练来着——。嘿嘿……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1012_p", "source_sha256": "38360bb03f5638f33bd709ff8306c677c5fdb70c2a81ca0f5eda4254f71435d5", "ja": "なるほど？　じゃあ、それなら……やよいさえ\nよければ、しばらく劇場用に練習してみるか？", "zh": "这样啊？那既然这样……如果弥生愿意，要不要先练习一阵子，准备在剧场演出？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "475ba4b9f48e7f441e030acc916c3de49e2dea645876c4ab53a8c88ed1c86141", "ja": "えっ、いいんですか！？", "zh": "咦，可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0361bdcc8d93a56f88b33984260539a97081439f6e05624aa23499c241ed14ec", "ja": "もちろん！　練習して、今回の仕事だけじゃなくて、\n劇場公演で披露するのもありだと思うよ。", "zh": "当然可以！多加练习的话，我觉得不仅是这次的工作，\n放到剧场公演上去表演也很不错哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "d1a1e18ce18b725aaf50fba4150bf75aa72c3440ae1f64cd5f324b5317d5c78c", "ja": "劇場の公演でトランペットをー！？\nそれって楽しそうですー♪", "zh": "在剧场公演上吹小号——！？\n听起来好像很有意思♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1016_p", "source_sha256": "218a005631d757530e34630c6a64ed28b87412c58db5b8e657d994e87aa4ee2e", "ja": "ああ。ファンの人たちも、実際に演奏するところを\n見たらきっと嬉しいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "是啊。粉丝们要是能亲眼看到实际演奏的样子，\n一定也会很开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "30d69ab3886607f081ee91dfe765861978910f9ba7241d1428fc01cb04841f0b", "ja": "うっうー！　ありがとうございますー！\n私、やってみたいですー！", "zh": "呜呜——！谢谢您——！\n我想试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "dbc52f7287e9c0a9fffd030e3a3a786fd1434cf5a4111b099e61691c14ace0cd", "ja": "実は演奏してみたい曲が、たくさんあって……\nどれにしようかなぁ……えへへ、迷っちゃいますー！", "zh": "其实我想演奏的曲子有好多好多……\n选哪首好呢……诶嘿嘿，都不知道该怎么选了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0573_1019_p", "source_sha256": "28011ee0ad24dbbdac363a3a70f4df9801565b9771aeac02f92ba71dda769d0f", "ja": "（その後、やよいは練習を重ね……\n劇場公演でも見事な演奏を披露してくれた！）", "zh": "（之后，弥生不断练习……还在剧场公演中为大家献上了精彩的演奏！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
